%SIXMD 1
# @?TTYOUT - CONTROL TERMINAL OUTPUT ROUTING

## @?OPERANDS

### @?TTY
NUMERIC TERMINAL ID.

### @?[SINK]
OPTIONAL OUTPUT SINK: NATIVE, CTY, DPY, OR ITS NUMERIC SINK VALUE.  WHEN
OMITTED, TTYOUT PRINTS THE CURRENT SINK.

## DESCRIPTION

TTYOUT QUERIES OR CHANGES THE OUTPUT ROUTE FOR ONE TERMINAL.
USAGE IS 'TTYOUT TTY [SINK]'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
